  "project_description": "This module adds a Revisions tab and revision history/revert UI to Webform configuration entities. It has no schema or settings of its own: it depends on the Config Revision module (which records a revision each time a webform is saved) and on Webform, and it wires Config Revision's generic version-history, revert and delete screens into the Webform admin UI under /admin/structure/webform/manage/{webform}/revisions. Access is governed by three dedicated permissions (view/revert/delete all webform revisions).",
